<mjml>
  <mj-include path="./partials/head.mjml" />
  <mj-body background-color="#FFFFFF" width="660px">
    <mj-include path="./partials/header.mjml" />

    <mj-section padding-top="12px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text>Hello,&nbsp;*|FNAME|*</mj-text>
        <mj-text>
          You have started saving in Tuleva’s third pillar fund, with low fees and a fact-based
          investment strategy. Your second pillar is currently invested elsewhere.
        </mj-text>
        <mj-text>
          For your third pillar you have already chosen a low-fee index fund. It is worth
          checking whether your second pillar fund follows the same principles: low fees and
          broad diversification.
        </mj-text>
        <mj-text>
          <strong>
            Check how much larger your second pillar would be if you were saving in a low-fee
            index fund:
          </strong>
        </mj-text>
        <mj-button href="https://pension.tuleva.ee/login?language=en">
          Check your second pillar
        </mj-button>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <mj-include path="./partials/contact_en.mjml" />
    <mj-section padding="0 24px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text padding-top="12px">Tõnu Pekk<br />Tuleva Founder and Fund Manager</mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
    <mj-include path="./partials/disclaimer_pension_en.mjml" />
    <mj-include path="./partials/footer_bottom_fund.mjml" />
  </mj-body>
</mjml>
